      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey! Thanks for the request.\n\nIs there a particular issue that prevents you from using tools like EasyQuestSwitch to disable/swap things that are specific per-platform?\n\nThe big reason for encouraging usage of the same scene is the automatic network id handling, so then things sync correctly between scenes (avoiding the need for exporting/importing them manually)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
