      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name} yes! EasyQuestSwitch was tested during development and should work just fine for Windows+Android multi-platform builds.\n\nExplicit iOS configuration will probably be added to EQS at a later date as well, but if you build all platforms starting from windows - it should still work, as it will apply changes for android, keeps them for iOS, and then switch things back for windows.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
