  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm sure there's plenty of reason to maintain different versions of a world for PC and Quest.\n\nLots of world functions can only be kept in PC.\n\nWhether or not this is an option determines whether or not I use this feature and thus determines my likelihood to bother making the quest version for all my worlds (versus only my most important ones) too.",
